---
# GNU C Style Configuration for MicroEmacs Variants
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: GNU

# Strict GNU Constraints
ColumnLimit: 79

# White Space & Line Endings
UseTab: Never
LineEnding: LF
TabWidth: 8
IndentWidth: 2
ContinuationIndentWidth: 4

# Bracket and Space Formatting Rules
BreakBeforeBraces: GNU
SpaceBeforeParens: Always

# Pointer and Field Adjustments
PointerAlignment: Right
AlignTrailingComments: true
---
